ould process long-standing customer's second contract with cursed, enchanted sword to return premium of 160 G -- integration example: 100 + 50 + 30 - 20 + 10 - 15 + 5 = 160\n22. should apply rounding up for final premium (e.g., 197.5 G → 198 G) -- in MHPCO's favor\n23. should apply rounding down for final payout (e.g., 350.5 G → 350 G) -- in MHPCO's favor"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950337951,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-ff0defae-2bae-4499-921e-2db70b801f05","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
